  "instructions": [
    "Heat the fish oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced ginger and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced chicken breast and cook until browned.",
    "Add the fish sauce, black pepper, salt, and coriander. Stir well.",
    "Add 2 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the bay leaves and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Serve the chicken and broth in a hot stone plate, garnished with a squeeze of unwaxed lemon juice.",
    "Optional: add a dash of chili pepper for extra heat."
